    "### Format compliance\n",
    "\n",
    "Whisper requires 16 kHz mono. This groups every distinct (sample rate, channels, subtype, format)\n",
    "combination so any inconsistency shows up immediately.\n",
    "\n",
    "The critical row is **sample rate below 16 kHz**. Unlike channel count or bit depth, this is not\n",
    "fixable: upsampling 8 kHz audio to 16 kHz interpolates samples but cannot restore frequency content\n",
    "that was never captured. Those clips stay permanently band-limited and will underperform, so it is\n",
    "better to know now than to be puzzled by the eval numbers later.\n",
    "\n",
