   "source": [
    "### Audition the worst offenders\n",
    "\n",
    "The flags detect *signal* problems; the ear detects *label* problems, and the latter hurt WER more.\n",
    "So we play the six highest-`n_flags` clips with their transcripts printed alongside.\n",
    "\n",
    "While listening, the questions are:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Does the audio contain **all** the words in the transcript? A near-silent clip with a full\n",
    "  sentence attached is a misaligned pair — training on it teaches the model to generate text from\n",
    "  nothing.\n",
    "- Is the utterance cut off mid-word at either end?\n",
    "- Is it silence plus one short phrase? The transcript may be fine, but the clip wastes a slot.\n",
    "- Is it noise or music with a plausible-looking transcript? Drop it.\n",
    "\n",
    "If the flagged clips sound perfectly normal, that is the absolute-threshold artefact described\n",
    "above rather than a data problem — which the VAD comparison below will confirm."
   ]
